    "contect_of_privacy": "This Privacy Policy outlines how we collect, use, store, and protect the information you provide when using our SIGN SAFE app. Information We Collect Personal Information: We may collect personal information such as your name, your age , your address ,contact details when you use our app to request emergency assistance. Device Information: We may collect device information, including IP address, device ID, and location data to provide emergency services. Use of Information We may use the information we collect for the following purposes: Providing emergency assistance and support. Improving our app's functionality and user experience. User Rights You have the right to access, rectify, delete, or restrict the processing of your personal data. You can change the language of the application and you can read books and watch movies related to sign language and learn how to use this language, and this helps communication between the deaf and the dumb and conveying mutual feelings between them and helps get rid of fear, depression and frustration among deaf and mute people. It works to develop the social, cognitive and cultural relationships of individuals Data Security We take appropriate measures to protect the information we collect from unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, or destruction. These measures include encryption, access controls, and regular security audits. Data Sharing We may share your information with third parties, including emergency responders, service providers, and legal authorities, to provide emergency assistance and comply with legal requirements. Data Retention We retain user data only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this Privacy Policy or as required by law. We will securely delete or anonymize user data when it is no longer needed ",
    "content_of_terms" : "Welcome to SIGN SAFE Application These Terms and Conditions govern your use of our emergency app, designed to provide assistance and support for individuals who are deaf or hard of hearing. By downloading, installing, or using our app, you agree to comply with these Terms and Conditions. 1.Use of the App: 1.1. You agree to use the app only for its intended purposes, including accessing emergency assistance and support services tailored for individuals who are deaf or hard of hearing. 1.2. You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials and for all activities that occur under your account. 2. Accessibility: 2.1. We are committed to ensuring accessibility for deaf individuals throughout our app. We provide features such as captioning, sign language support, and alternative communication methods to facilitate effective communication and access to emergency services. 3. Emergency Response Disclaimer:  3.1. While we strive to provide timely and effective emergency assistance, we do not guarantee immediate or successful response in all situations. Emergency situations may vary, and our app may not be suitable for all emergencies. 4. Limitation of Liability: 4.1. To the fullest extent permitted by law, we shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or exemplary damages arising out of or in connection with your use of the app. 5. Prohibited Activities: 5.1. You agree not to engage in any illegal or unauthorized activities when using the app, including but not limited to: Attempting to disrupt the app's functionality. Violating the rights of other users. Transmitting any harmful or malicious content. 6. Changes to Terms and Conditions: 6.1. We reserve the right to update or modify these Terms and Conditions at any time without prior notice. Your continued use of the app after any changes indicates your acceptance of the updated Terms and Conditions.",
    "content_of_about" : "Welcome to Our Application We are dedicated to providing essential emergency assistance and support tailored specifically for the deaf and hard of hearing community. Our mission is to ensure that everyone, regardless of their hearing ability, can access critical emergency services during times of need. SIGN SAFE Application was created to address the unique challenges faced by deaf individuals during emergencies, where traditional communication methods may be ineffective. We understand the importance of providing accessible solutions that empower deaf individuals to seek help and receive support when it matters most. At SIGN SAFE we understand that effective communication during emergencies is crucial, even without using traditional communication methods such as spoken language or telephone communications. Our application is designed to provide clear and concise information and instructions by inputting an SOS signal through the camera. Get in Touch: We value your feedback and input. If you have any questions, suggestions, or feedback, please don't hesitate to reach out to us. Your input helps us improve our app and better serve the needs of the deaf community. Thank you for choosing our application as your trusted emergency companion!"
